color:rgb(26,32,44);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >Hi&#7879;n t&#432;&#7907;ng "Bufferbloat" (&#249;n &#7913; b&#7897; &#273;&#7879;m) l&#224; nguy&#234;n nh&#226;n s&#7889; 1 khi&#7871;n h&#236;nh &#7843;nh b&#7883; tr&#7877; (delay) t&#7915; 5 &#273;&#7871;n 10 gi&#226;y khi truy&#7873;n qua Internet. N&#7871;u Camera c&#7913; li&#234;n t&#7909;c ch&#7909;p v&#224; &#273;&#7849;y v&#224;o socket m&#7841;ng trong khi &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng truy&#7873;n m&#7841;ng b&#7883; ch&#7853;m, c&#225;c b&#7913;c &#7843;nh c&#361; s&#7869; n&#7857;m ch&#7845;t &#273;&#7889;ng trong h&#224;ng &#273;&#7907;i c&#7911;a Router ho&#7863;c Server. Khi xem tr&#234;n m&#224;n h&#236;nh, ng&#432;&#7901;i &#273;i&#7873;u khi&#7875;n s&#7869; nh&#236;n th&#7845;y h&#236;nh &#7843;nh c&#7911;a 5 gi&#226;y tr&#432;&#7899;c, c&#7921;c k&#7923; ngu</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
