background:rgb(26,32,44);mso-shading:rgb(26,32,44);color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(255,255,255);" >#define PWDN_GPIO_NUM 32 // Ch&#226;n &#273;i&#7873;u khi&#7875;n ngu&#7891;n c&#7843;m bi&#7871;n (Power Down, t&#237;ch c&#7921;c m&#7913;c cao) #define RESET_GPIO_NUM -1 // Ch&#226;n Reset c&#7843;m bi&#7871;n (kh&#244;ng d&#249;ng, n&#7889;i ph&#7847;n c&#7913;ng s&#7861;n) #define XCLK_GPIO_NUM 0 // Xung nh&#7883;p &#273;&#7891;ng h&#7891; ch&#7911; c&#7845;p cho camera (20MHz) #define SIOD_GPIO_NUM 26 // Ch&#226;n d&#7919; li&#7879;u I2C c&#7845;u h&#236;nh thanh ghi c&#7843;m bi&#7871;n (SCCB Data) #define SIOC_GPIO_NUM 27 // Ch&#226;n xung clock I2C c&#7845;u h&#236;nh thanh ghi c&#7843;m bi&#7871;n (SCCB Clock) #define Y9_GPIO_NUM 35 // Bit d&#7919; li&#7879;u &#7843;nh D7 #define Y8_GPIO_NUM 34 // Bit d&#7919; li&#7879;u &#7843;nh D6 #define Y7_GPIO_NUM 39 // Bit d&#7919; li&#7879;u &#7843;nh D5 #define Y6_GPIO_NUM 36 // Bit d&#7919; li&#7879;u &#7843;nh D4 #define Y5_GPIO_NUM 21 // Bit d&#7919; li&#7879;u &#7843;nh D3 #define Y4_GPIO_NUM 19 // Bit d&#7919; li&#7879;u &#7843;nh D2 #define Y3_GPIO_NUM 18 // Bit d&#7919; li&#7879;u &#7843;nh D1 #define Y2_GPIO_NUM 5 // Bit d&#7919; li&#7879;u &#7843;nh D0 #define VSYNC_GPIO_NUM 25 // T&#237;n hi&#7879;u &#273;&#7891;ng b&#7897; d&#7885;c (Vertical Sync - b&#225;o b&#7855;t &#273;&#7847;u khung h&#236;nh m&#7899;i) #define HREF_GPIO_NUM 23 // T&#237;n hi&#7879;u &#273;&#7891;ng b&#7897; ngang (Horizontal Reference - b&#225;o d&#242;ng &#273;i&#7875;m &#7843;nh) #define PCLK_GPIO_NUM 22 // Xung nh&#7883;p &#273;i&#7875;m &#7843;nh (Pixel Clock - ch&#7889;t t&#7915;ng byte d&#7919; li&#7879;u) </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:Consolas;
color:rgb(226,232,240);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><i><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(26,32,44);font-style:italic;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&#221; ngh&#297;a k&#7929; thu&#7853;t:</span></i><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(26,32,44);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;Kh&#7889;i &#273;&#7883;nh ngh&#297;a n&#224;y t&#432;&#417;ng th&#237;ch tuy&#7879;t &#273;&#7889;i v&#7899;i ph&#7847;n c&#7913;ng bo m&#7841;ch AI-Thinker ESP32-CAM. T&#7847;n s&#7889; xung nh&#7883;p XCLK &#273;&#432;&#7907;c c&#7845;p t&#7915; b&#7897; t&#7841;o xung nh&#7883;p LEDC b&#234;n trong ESP32 v&#7899;i t&#7847;n s&#7889; chu&#7849;n 20MHz &#273;&#7875; c&#7843;m bi&#7871;n OV2640 ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7897;ng &#7893;n &#273;&#7883;nh nh&#7845;t. </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(45,55,72);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >Kh&#7889;i 2: C&#7845;u h&#236;nh ph&#7847;n c&#7913;ng v&#224; ph&#226;n b&#7893; b&#7897; &#273;&#7879;m DMA trong h&#224;m setup()</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
