mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >Kh&#7889;i 5: H&#224;m thu gom byte ACK t&#7915; Server v&#224; ki&#7875;m so&#225;t &#273;&#7897; tr&#7877; (drainServerAcks)</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
