background:rgb(26,32,44);mso-shading:rgb(26,32,44);color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(255,255,255);" >void drainServerAcks() { while (secureClient.available() &gt; 0) { uint8_t b = secureClient.read(); if (b == 'K') { // Server &#273;&#227; x&#7917; l&#253; xong khung h&#236;nh tr&#432;&#7899;c v&#224; g&#7917;i ph&#7843;n h&#7891;i if (in_flight_frames &gt; 0) in_flight_frames--; } } } </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:Consolas;
