color:rgb(26,32,44);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;Do tr&#7909;c ph&#225;t quang v&#224; tr&#7909;c thu nh&#7853;n c&#7911;a th&#7845;u k&#237;nh c&#7843;m bi&#7871;n n&#7857;m l&#7879;ch nhau m&#7897;t kho&#7843;ng c&#225;ch c&#417; h&#7885;c, g&#243;c qu&#233;t th&#7921;c t&#7871; c&#7847;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c hi&#7879;u ch&#7881;nh b&#7857;ng c&#244;ng th&#7913;c l&#432;&#7907;ng gi&#225;c: \[Angle_{Corrected} = Angle_i + \arctan\left(\frac{21.8 \times (155.3 - Distance_i)}{155.3 \times Distance_i}\right)\] B&#7897; gi&#7843;i m&#227; tr&#234;n Server t&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng &#225;p d&#7909;ng c&#244;ng th&#7913;c n&#224;y, &#273;&#7843;m b&#7843;o c&#225;c b&#7913;c t&#432;&#7901;ng ph&#7859;ng trong nh&#224; x&#432;&#7903;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c hi&#7875;n th&#7883; th&#224;nh c&#225;c &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng th&#7859;ng tuy&#7879;t &#273;&#7889;i tr&#234;n m&#224;n h&#236;nh radar, kh&#244;ng b&#7883; m&#233;o cong d&#7841;ng c&#225;nh cung. </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
