color:rgb(26,32,44);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >H&#7879; th&#7889;ng t&#237;nh to&#225;n Odometry d&#7921; ki&#7871;n d&#7921;a tr&#234;n t&#237;ch ph&#226;n v&#7853;n t&#7889;c theo th&#7901;i gian: \[x_{t} = x_{t-1} + v \cdot \cos(\theta) \cdot \Delta t\] \[y_{t} = y_{t-1} + v \cdot \sin(\theta) \cdot \Delta t\] \[\theta_{t} = \theta_{t-1} + \omega \cdot \Delta t\] Qu&#7929; &#273;&#7841;o di chuy&#7875;n c&#7911;a xe AGV &#273;&#432;&#7907;c v&#7869; th&#224;nh m&#7897;t &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng n&#233;t &#273;&#7913;t m&#224;u l&#7909;c lam ph&#225;t s&#225;ng (Cyan Trail) tr&#234;n m&#224;n h&#236;nh radar, gi&#250;p theo d&#245;i l&#7897; tr&#236;nh di chuy&#7875;n c&#7911;a xe trong ca l&#224;m vi&#7879;c. </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(43,108,176);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >3.3. Gi&#7843;i th&#237;ch chi ti&#7871;t m&#227; ngu&#7891;n t&#7915;ng kh&#7889;i c&#7911;a esp32_s3_lidar.ino</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
