color:rgb(26,32,44);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >: </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(45,55,72);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >Kh&#7889;i 1: Thu&#7853;t to&#225;n th&#7917; nghi&#7879;m c&#7863;p ch&#226;n Lidar (tryLidarPinPair)</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(45,55,72);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:8.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:8.0000pt;
margin-left:0.0000pt;border-left:4.5000pt solid rgb(5,196,107);mso-border-left-alt:4.5000pt solid rgb(5,196,107);
padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 12pt ;word-break:break-all;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;
text-align:left;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;background:rgb(26,32,44);" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:Consolas;
color:rgb(226,232,240);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;
background:rgb(26,32,44);mso-shading:rgb(26,32,44);color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(255,255,255);" >bool tryLidarPinPair(int rx_pin, int motor_pin, long baud) { // C&#7845;u h&#236;nh ch&#226;n k&#237;ch motor &#7903; m&#7913;c ng&#245; ra v&#224; k&#233;o l&#234;n m&#7913;c CAO &#273;&#7875; c&#7845;p ngu&#7891;n motor quay pinMode(motor_pin, OUTPUT); digitalWrite(motor_pin, HIGH); delay(100); // Kh&#7903;i &#273;&#7897;ng c&#7893;ng UART ph&#7847;n c&#7913;ng s&#7889; 1 v&#7899;i b&#7897; &#273;&#7879;m l&#7899;n 4096 bytes SerialLidar.end(); SerialLidar.setRxBufferSize(4096); SerialLidar.begin(baud, SERIAL_8N1, rx_pin, -1); // Ph&#225;t chu&#7895;i xung k&#237;ch ho&#7841;t kh&#7903;i &#273;&#7897;ng motor YDLidar X2 (L&#7879;nh chu&#7849;n 0xA5 0x60) uint8_t start_scan_cmd[2] = {0xA5, 0x60}; pinMode(rx_pin, OUTPUT); for (int i = 0; i &lt; 2; i++) { digitalWrite(rx_pin, LOW); delayMicroseconds(100); digitalWrite(rx_pin, HIGH); delayMicroseconds(100); } SerialLidar.begin(baud, SERIAL_8N1, rx_pin, -1); // &#272;&#432;a ch&#226;n v&#7873; l&#7841;i ch&#7871; &#273;&#7897; nh&#7853;n UART RX // Ch&#7901; v&#224; l&#7855;ng nghe xem c&#243; d&#242;ng byte nh&#7883; ph&#226;n n&#224;o t&#7915; Lidar &#273;&#7893; v&#7873; kh&#244;ng unsigned long start_wait = millis(); int bytes_read = 0; while (millis() - start_wait &lt; 600) { if (SerialLidar.available()) { SerialLidar.read(); bytes_read++; if (bytes_read &gt;= 16) { // Nh&#7853;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c t&#7915; 16 byte tr&#7903; l&#234;n -&gt; X&#225;c nh&#7853;n &#272;&#218;NG CH&#194;N! return true; } } delay(2); } return false; // H&#7871;t 600ms m&#224; kh&#244;ng c&#243; d&#7919; li&#7879;u -&gt; Ch&#226;n sai, c&#7847;n &#273;&#7843;o ch&#226;n } </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:Consolas;
color:rgb(226,232,240);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><i><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(26,32,44);font-style:italic;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&#221; ngh&#297;a k&#7929; thu&#7853;t:</span></i><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(26,32,44);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;H&#224;m n&#224;y ki&#7875;m tra t&#237;nh to&#224;n v&#7865;n c&#7911;a ph&#7847;n c&#7913;ng trong th&#7901;i gian c&#7921;c ng&#7855;n (600ms). Vi&#7879;c thi&#7871;t l&#7853;p b&#7897; &#273;&#7879;m nh&#7853;n </span><b><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:Consolas;
color:rgb(197,48,48);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
background:rgb(237,242,247);mso-shading:rgb(237,242,247);" >SerialLidar.setRxBufferSize(4096)</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(26,32,44);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;ng&#259;n ch&#7863;n hi&#7879;n t&#432;&#7907;ng tr&#224;n b&#7897; &#273;&#7879;m ph&#7847;n c&#7913;ng FIFO c&#7911;a UART khi Lidar ph&#225;t d&#7919; li&#7879;u li&#234;n t&#7909;c &#7903; t&#7889;c &#273;&#7897; cao. </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(45,55,72);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >Kh&#7889;i 2: H&#224;m t&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng d&#242; v&#224; kh&#243;a ch&#226;n t&#237;n hi&#7879;u (autoDetectLidarPin)</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(45,55,72);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:8.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:8.0000pt;
