color:rgb(26,32,44);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >, ESP32-S3 k&#7871;t n&#7889;i tr&#7921;c ti&#7871;p v&#224;o m&#225;y ch&#7911; m&#7897;t c&#225;ch nh&#7865; nh&#224;ng, &#7893;n &#273;&#7883;nh v&#224; t&#432;&#417;ng th&#237;ch 100% v&#7899;i m&#7885;i phi&#234;n b&#7843;n ESP32 Arduino Core! </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
