mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >Kh&#7889;i 4: &#272;&#7885;c l&#7879;nh &#273;i&#7873;u khi&#7875;n &#273;&#7897;ng h&#7885;c t&#7913;c th&#7901;i t&#7915; Server (readIncomingServerCommands)</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:SimSun;
color:rgb(45,55,72);font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:8.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:8.0000pt;
